{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "k4flow",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Avatar 绑定流程（Host 编排）\n1. 服务器 `AttachAvatar(NewPawn)` 或客户端 `OnRep_AvatarPawn` → `BindAvatar`：绑定进行中再请求 → Reentrant；同一 Pawn → AlreadyBound；宿主关闭、Pawn 无效、宿主死亡、Pawn 已绑别处 → 对应拒绝。\n2. 释放旧 Avatar：取消能力（保留 `Ability.Behavior.SurvivesDeath`）→ 清输入 → 移除全部 Cue → ActorInfo 回到 Owner-only（宿主关闭时 `ClearActorInfo`）→ 旧 Pawn 的 Extension 广播 Released。\n3. `InitAbilityActorInfo(宿主, 新Pawn)`：ASC 覆盖在端点变化时清输入，新 Pawn Avatar 通知能力实例并尝试 OnSpawn。订阅新 Pawn 的 `OnEndPlay／OnDestroyed`，服务器写 `AvatarPawn`。\n4. 新 Pawn 的 Extension 广播 Ready，本地订阅（Hero、CMC、Health、LocomotionFX）各自消费；订阅时回放 Ready，重复 Ready 不回调。\nController 变化只 `RefreshAbilityActorInfo`；换人不重绑。[[Combatants/结构|Host]] · [[AbilitySystem/结构#Avatar 绑定|接口]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1750,
      "width": 1850,
      "color": "6",
      "height": 330
    },
    {
      "id": "grant",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "1. 状态宿主创建 ASC 与基础属性，并按 AbilitySet 授予 GA / GE。\n\n调用：CombatantState 构造 ASC/属性 → CharacterSlot::InitializeForPawnData(PawnData) → AbilitySet::GiveToAbilitySystem(ASC, Handles, Source)。",
      "width": 385,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5",
      "x": -960,
      "y": 343
    },
    {
      "id": "request",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "2. Hero观察原ActionInstance：首观察先锁定Tag/deadline，再Receive取得原ID；未Ready/拒绝也不在同Action中补发。\n真实Completed/Canceled→End原ID(Released)；Hero会话退役→EndAbilityInputRequestsFromSource以Invalidated结束本会话全部请求。\nPlayerController::PostProcessInput→唯一Process冻结原边沿来源→输入尝试作用域内TryActivateAbility→激活才消费请求。\nremote接受不证明本地Activation；Boss Query不携玩家输入来源。",
      "width": 385,
      "height": 370,
      "color": "5",
      "x": -100,
      "y": 273
    },
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# AbilitySystem｜流程图\n能力请求→TryActivateAbility→PreActivate签发激活身份→动作与Task→RequestAbilityEnd／Cancel→Cleanup后原生End→OnAbilityEnded。\nRequiredPose路径先Acquire再原生Tick Poll；失败先EndTask，再发送OnFailed，由GA决定原能力终止。\n[[GGYGO_结构_AbilitySystem.canvas|结构]] · [[AbilitySystem/结构|接口]] · [[GGYGO_流程_玩家普攻连段.canvas|连段流程]] · [[GGYGO_流程_原请求终止.canvas|激活与结束]] · [[GGYGO_流程_能力仲裁.canvas|仲裁]] · [[GGYGO_流程_伤害结算.canvas|结算]]",
      "width": 1650,
      "height": 210,
      "color": "6",
      "x": -310,
      "y": -140
    },
    {
      "id": "check",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "3. 原生 Try → GA::CanActivateAbility（final）。\n\n进入 Can 作用域记录层级，返栈时恢复。\nActorInfo → 原生 GAS/BP、冷却、成本、Tag → 输入换人回场门 → 组准入 → CanActivateAbilityAdditional。\n输入 Try 的直接 Can 可读输入来源；其内部的 raw Try／查询没有该许可。\nCan 返回后原生通知成功或失败；只有回到输入 Try 进入层级的通知能认领原来源。\n组规则见 [[GGYGO_流程_能力仲裁.canvas|仲裁子图]]。",
      "x": 940,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "5",
      "y": 258
    },
    {
      "id": "end",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "5. 固定Original→RequestAbilityEnd/Cancel（Accepted／NotCurrent／NotCancelable；ScopeLock期间延后并重核）。\nfinal End一次CleanupAbilityResourcesForTermination(Context)→native End；派生只归还自己的原资源，Task执行自身清理。\nASC NotifyAbilityEnded在原生广播前退役激活身份；外部等待订阅原生OnAbilityEnded按Spec匹配。\n组空或Task Completed都不代表GA结束。\n[[GGYGO_流程_原请求终止.canvas|激活与结束]]",
      "width": 400,
      "height": 390,
      "color": "1",
      "x": -100,
      "y": 1047
    },
    {
      "id": "active",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "4. 原生PreActivate→ASC NotifyAbilityActivated → GA签Original，ASC登记准入序号/预留。\nActiveCount++ → final Activate：Initialize(Original)一次初始化原激活资源。\n原激活仍有效→Finalize终检/完成原attempt→相机/offset→Body(Original,原参数)，默认native Super/BP。\n每个外调返回重核Original；已结束不执行旧Body。派生持自己的原Task/窗口/句柄。\n[[GGYGO_流程_原请求终止.canvas|激活与结束]]",
      "width": 420,
      "height": 430,
      "color": "1",
      "x": 940,
      "y": 992
    },
    {
      "id": "fail",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "拒绝：NotifyAbilityFailed（final）。\n复制FailureTags→一次消费本层Can/原输入来源；原生前置拒绝先耗尽匹配许可。\n真实Queued且原源有效→ASC登记原Spec许可与首次等待顺序，再Super原失败反馈。\nSuper回调可释放占位；内部等待已可被真实组空消费。\nSuper返回重核原ASC/GA/ID/Tag/deadline/Policy→OnAbilityInputRetryable观察；Hero不保存等待或Queue。\nHandleAbilityFailed及客户端原路由保持；raw/Query/失效来源不借Retry许可。",
      "width": 420,
      "height": 490,
      "color": "3",
      "x": 1920,
      "y": 242
    },
    {
      "id": "ability-input-ordered-edge-flow",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 700,
      "height": 670,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## Process输入消费\n入口：AbilityInputBlocked或ActorInfo不可用→清空；SwitchReturnPending登记过且标签已移除→唤醒一次等待。\nReceive冻结原ID/Tag/deadline及首次Spec集合，记录真实边沿；多个held来源按OR保持。\nProcess外调前捕Edges，逐Edge冻结InitialSourcesByEdge；Press A→Release A→Press B不让B进入A的Can来源。\n同边沿合并来源；每次Process每个Spec至多一次Try，剩余边沿经DeferredEdges留到下次PostProcess。\n输入尝试作用域包一次TryActivateAbility；本次许可先消费，激活才消费请求。\nCan 作用域记录嵌套层级；返至输入 Try 的进入层级后，Notify 才认领该来源。\n带 GroupQueued／SwitchReturnPending 的失败在原生反馈前登记原许可，反馈后广播仍有效的重试通知。\nPendingRetries仍经原ID/Tag/deadline/Policy核对，FiniteRetry不重开窗口。\nReleased按最后held发释放，未过期Triggered tap可retry；WhileInputActive有限retry另需held。\nInvalidated不伪Released；deadline只退休有限许可/等待/Pending，不松键。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#单次 Can 评估与输入失败来源|输入接口]]",
      "x": 2380,
      "y": -183
    },
    {
      "id": "damage",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "原Owned hit→共享Builder。\nCombo显式无GE成功载荷直接Cue；Boss要求有效GE。有效Spec走GE／Execution／HealthSet元属性，并保留碰撞Cue。\n必需依赖／Builder失败不Apply/Cue：Combo正式End固定Original，Boss只拒该hit。\nHealthSet的Current目标／ASC计算／原Base提交见本图下方数值分支。\n[[GGYGO_流程_伤害结算.canvas|命中分支]] · [[Messages/结构#HealthSet 的 Current 结算|Current结算]]",
      "width": 420,
      "height": 360,
      "color": "4",
      "x": 2000,
      "y": 992
    },
    {
      "id": "w0-original-input-subscription-flow",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 原输入Task订阅流程\n调用方：WaitComboInput→SetSourceStep→可选RegisterNativeCallback→ReadyForActivation；工厂/BP签名保持。native闭包按值捕原Activation、弱GA/原Task。\n① Activate外调前捕原弱ASC/Ability、Spec/key、remote/predict模式、自身handle→原桶AbilityReplicatedEventDelegate(InputPressed).Add。零key合法，只定位桶。\n② remote CallReplicatedEventDelegateIfSet返回→重取弱原Task，核开放/原订阅/来源/handle→未回放才最后SetWaitingOnRemotePlayerData；A结束不能写Waiting。\n③ HandlePress：remote GetReplicatedDataOfGenericReplicatedEvent；本地计数，predict才ServerSetReplicatedEventWithPayload→ConsumeGenericReplicatedEvent，均原Spec/key。\nX[0,65535]／Y[1,65535]整数校验保持，非法载荷诊断并消费原事件后拒绝通知。原FScopedPredictionWindow覆盖通知。\n原Consume→不可变native/载荷快照→native与捕获析构返回→弱原Task/精确原订阅重检→原OnPress BP；native结束A不发A BP。\n④ OnDestroy先关、脱native及订阅→原桶remove自身handle→Super返回→释放捕获，之后无Task访问；不Consume后继。\n必需来源非法诊断/结束自身，不从GA current补桶，不新增GA身份或调度。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#原事件桶与输入Task订阅|订阅接口]]",
      "width": 950,
      "color": "5",
      "x": 1945,
      "y": 1422,
      "height": 430
    },
    {
      "id": "k3-play-result",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 1｜Task先决契约与完整播放返回\n创建Task后、Ready前RegisterNativeCallbacks→精确token：原五普通回调＋SectionReceived／NotifyReceived＋typed OnFailed。原Activation/弱GA/原Task由调用方固定捕获。\nActivate捕原Ability/ActorInfo allocation/ASC/Mesh/Anim与Montage真实唯一Slot。\n→原Guard.AcquireActionPoseContract：ExplicitNotRequired明确普通模式；RequiredReady须有效原Ticket/失败消费者；Rejected/Unavailable或Ticket不一致→Startup失败(ID=NONE)，不播放。\n原资格有效→自身Cancel/Event订阅→PlayAbilityMontage(原参数/pureQuery)。\nASC捕源→GuardScope→完整Super.PlayMontage→Complete→复制Result并退出Scope；Accepted且真实Local/原源一致才签Playback。\nTask消费同一栈Result；失败/Superseded不清后继、不裸播放/扫描新实例或假Duration成功。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构|接口输入输出]] · [[Animation/动作姿态修正|声明与Acquire]]\n显式作者点订阅在Ready前ConfigureOriginalMontageNotify；声明、派发与清理见右侧分支。",
      "width": 950,
      "color": "5",
      "x": 3320,
      "y": 600,
      "height": 392
    },
    {
      "id": "k3-original-resource",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 2｜原资源安装与Required-only只读Poll\n原返回重检Task/Ability/ActorInfo；在途停止义务按Result.Guard清原实例。已结束Task不安装资源。\n成功→保存原Playback（Guard／PlayInstanceId／所属激活）→精确BlendOut/Ended/Section委托与配置的原NotifyBegin订阅→原scale lease→SetWaitingOnAvatar；最后外调后无成员写。\nReady返回：GA用TryGetOriginalSectionSnapshot固定实际ID/Section/Position/Rate，GA按原范围调用CMC BeginMontageActionMotion；SectionReceived报告原转段。\n仅RequiredReady启用原GameplayTasks Tick；TickTask不消费dt或求姿态，只向原Guard.PollActionPoseContract。\nPoll前后核原Task/Ability/ActorInfo/ASC/Guard；Valid继续，Failed/Invalidated→Playback失败(原ID)，不重新Acquire或静默跳过弱来源丢失。\n普通Event/Section仍核精确原实例和自身资格；票据不是播放/GA权力，CMC仍唯一胶囊执行。\n[[GGYGO_流程_玩家普攻连段.canvas|Main/End消费]] · [[Animation/动作姿态修正|姿态执行/epoch]]",
      "width": 950,
      "color": "4",
      "x": 3320,
      "y": 1297,
      "height": 340
    },
    {
      "id": "k3-exact-clear",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 3｜原BlendOut精确Clear\n原实例携Guard回调→MatchesOriginalMontageCallback→标混出，释放自身缩放。\nTask→ASC ClearPlayback(原Playback)：仍为当前播放才清AnimatingAbility与能力CurrentMontage，不停止Montage。\n已被后继B替换时返回false，不触碰B。\n不Stop／延期到技能结束。\n原BlendOut/Interrupted：原包/载荷快照→native及捕获析构返回→弱原Task、同原Guard/ActorInfo/Task资格重检→既有BP；原Task关闭不继续旧BP。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#精确Montage播放归属|播放接口]]",
      "width": 950,
      "color": "1",
      "x": 3320,
      "y": 1920,
      "height": 290
    },
    {
      "id": "k3-task-original-ended",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 4｜自然结束、普通取消与Required失败\n自然原Ended：原Guard生命周期/ActorInfo/Task资格成立且非Interrupted→原包/载荷快照→native/捕获析构返回→原资格重检→BP Completed→自身EndTask。\n不Check已退休当前ASC归属，不要求原实例仍活动。Completed只原实例事实；GA另核Original，不授后继结束权。\n普通ExternalCancel/AbilityCancel/FailAndEndTask保持Cancelled与原Stop策略，各渠道至多一次。\nRequired失败独立路径：关闭普通Event/Section/完成入口→精确Stop原实例/释放scale→EndTask清自身订阅/Ticket→历史typed OnFailed。\nFact=原Montage/真实Slot/Stage/Diagnostic；Startup NONE，Playback确切原ID。\nUE EndTask已清Task.Ability并垃圾标记；历史发送者WeakTask.Get(true)拒RF销毁，GA核原激活/段/强Task/原资源，随后正式原End(true,true)。不能用live-Task/Guard门禁吞失败。\nnative消费者若真实结束原激活/同UObject接续，临时原End观察使旧BP不交付；无原End且历史资格成立才BP OnFailed。\nOnDestroy先关/脱包，再原AnimInstance自身NotifyBegin及Cancel/Event/实例/scale/Ticket清理；Tick标志保持到引擎退休登记，捕获释放后无旧Task写。\n普通停止仍按原Guard/ID，ASC认证且活动ID同原才CurrentMontageStop，否则仅精确本地原资源；不找当前Avatar/后继。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#Task原实例与资源消费|Task契约]] · [[GGYGO_流程_玩家普攻连段.canvas|失败处理]]",
      "width": 950,
      "color": "1",
      "x": 3320,
      "y": 2450,
      "height": 430
    },
    {
      "id": "montage-notify-configure",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 原作者点的pre-Ready配置\n调用方→ResolveOriginalMontageNotify(Montage,Name,OutTime,Diagnostic)。\n恰一同名stock UAnimNotify_PlayMontageNotify；原LinkedMontage／branchingpoint／含offset有限TriggerTime，无同名Window／子类／重复。\nConfigureOriginalMontageNotify(Name,Diagnostic)仅原AwaitingActivation一次；保存原Notify UObject／名字／时间。\nReady前原RegisterNativeCallbacks包提供NotifyReceived。\nActivate复核声明与消费者；失败不播放，不以Main／End／旧ASC事件替代。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#原生 Montage 作者信号|配置与失败]]",
      "width": 930,
      "color": "5",
      "x": 4760,
      "y": 747,
      "height": 245
    },
    {
      "id": "montage-notify-subscribe",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 成功原Result后安装订阅\nPlayAbilityMontage返回→重核原Task/Ability/ActorInfo。\n成功→原Playback／Guard／int32 ID→确切原实例。\n声明仍匹配→原ActivatedAnimInstance.OnPlayMontageNotifyBegin.AddDynamic(本Task,OnOriginalMontageNotifyBegin)。\n播放外调后声明改变→清原播放、重取弱原Task后FailAndEndTask。\n不查同资产当前播放、不接ASC CancelPoint；Ready返回可读快照，原native点触发则核payload。",
      "x": 5250,
      "y": 1450,
      "width": 880,
      "color": "4",
      "height": 270
    },
    {
      "id": "montage-notify-startup-snapshot",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Ready后读取原位置\nGA核原Activation／StepToken／Task／资源→TryGetOriginalMontageNotifySnapshot(Fact,Position)。\n原Task／Guard／ActorInfo／声明有效→按固定ID读仍存在的原实例，位置须有限。\n输出原Montage／Mesh／ID／Name／作者TriggerTime及实际Position；false清输出。\nGA待同原Scope／CMC Handle就绪后解释非零纠正起点是否已越点；早期原信号也留在同原资源。\n不合成Notify／ASC事件、不锁业务门、不查询后继。\n[[GGYGO_流程_玩家普攻连段.canvas|GA初始化消费]]",
      "y": 1450,
      "width": 900,
      "color": "4",
      "x": 6680,
      "height": 240
    },
    {
      "id": "montage-notify-authenticate",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 原native点→精确原来源\nUE stock BranchingPointNotify→原AnimInstance.OnPlayMontageNotifyBegin。\nOnOriginalMontageNotifyBegin核Name、原Mesh/Montage、非NONE int32 ID和有效ConfiguredNotify。\n无外调段仅一次ResolveNativeMontageNotify：payload.NotifyEvent须等于原数组唯一配置点，UObject/TriggerTime一致。\n再核CanDispatchOriginalInstanceFact的原Guard/Lifecycle/ActorInfo/Task开放、固定ID实例及有限Position。\n自然blend不要求已退休ASC当前归属；旧Task/ID拒绝。\n复制值Fact→DispatchValidatedOriginalMontageNotifyFact；不外传借用payload。",
      "x": 5250,
      "width": 880,
      "color": "5",
      "y": 1860,
      "height": 260
    },
    {
      "id": "montage-notify-deliver",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 原包派发与消费\n前段认证完成→DispatchValidatedOriginalMontageNotifyFact捕弱原Task/Ability/ASC、原Guard与不可变包。\nNativeSnapshot.NotifyReceived.ExecuteIfBound(Fact)。\nnative和快照捕获析构完整返回→重取弱原Task、核原Ability/ASC/Guard/ActorInfo/实例，并重新解析原作者声明。\n原源仍匹配才BP NotifyReceived.Broadcast(Fact)；原Task关闭不继续旧BP，BP后无Task访问。\n公开TryGetOriginalMontageNotifySnapshot保留独立完整认证。\nGA另核原Activation/StepToken/Task/资源，事实不授GA/输入/镜头/CMC工作权。\n[[GGYGO_流程_玩家普攻连段.canvas|原资源业务门]]",
      "width": 900,
      "color": "1",
      "x": 6640,
      "y": 1860,
      "height": 270
    },
    {
      "id": "montage-notify-rejected",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 原声明／来源拒绝\nResolve／Configure失败→false、清输出与Diagnostic，调用方处理原配置失败。\nActivate声明失效或缺消费者→FailAndEndTask，保持Cancelled语义，不播放。\n播放外调后声明改变→精确停原资源、重检原Task后失败。\nnative来源不符／旧ID／退休Task→不派发、不授门。\n快照不可读→false清两输出，调用方定位原资源失败。\n不借End／另一通知／float事件兜底，不恢复旧工作权。",
      "width": 930,
      "color": "3",
      "x": 4600,
      "y": 2605,
      "height": 235
    },
    {
      "id": "montage-notify-retire",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 原Task退休清理\n原自然Ended／取消或调用方退Task→OnDestroy。\n先关闭入口并脱原native包→原ActivatedAnimInstance.RemoveDynamic(本Task,OnOriginalMontageNotifyBegin)。\n只撤原对象／自身函数；UE动态多播无FDelegateHandle，不Clear全表、不查新AnimInstance。\n按原策略退自己的Cancel/Event／实例／scale／Ticket→Super返回→释放捕获，之后无Task写。\n晚到原payload及已退休Task不污染同资产新播放。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#原生 Montage 作者信号|订阅寿命]]",
      "width": 900,
      "color": "1",
      "x": 6640,
      "y": 2360,
      "height": 245
    },
    {
      "id": "numeric-authority-current-target",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 权威Current目标\nDamage／Healing／PoiseDamage：\nPreGameplayEffectExecute先调用ASC计算Current→同Current，只预检支持性；Ready不保存候选，不写资源属性。\nPre拒绝→拒绝该Modifier；接受→原GE写meta。\nPostGameplayEffectExecute清自身meta贡献，等待该原生回调返回，再重读Current／Max并按MinimumHealth与0～Max生成目标。\n权威Max下降且Current超界→TrySetCurrentValue目标为新Max。\n[[Messages/结构#HealthSet 的 Current 结算|HealthSet目标与原帧]]",
      "width": 700,
      "color": "4",
      "x": -880,
      "y": 6760,
      "height": 280
    },
    {
      "id": "numeric-native-base-calculation",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## capture与栈内计算\nHealthSet→GGYGOAttributeBase::CalculateBaseForCurrent(ASC/原Set/属性/ExpectedCurrent/DesiredCurrent)。\n核线程/权威/注册来源/有限输入→经ASC公开接口native Capture和默认/CustomQualifies资格外调；返回重核原源。\nGGYGOAttributeCalculation::PrepareNativeAttributeCalculationChannels处理已认证快照，输出原生通道/顺序；非法Divisor/倍率/Override/非有限值→Rejected。\n通道逆序native bool ReverseEvaluate→正序native求值→IsAttributeForwardValueConfirmed核目标。\n重新capture实际聚合器并native正向回验；外调返回重核原宿主/Base/Current。\nHasSameAttributeAggregation比较两冻结快照；原源/资格变化→Stale。\n通过→Ready/None/有限CalculatedBase；所有临时值仅本栈存活，不调用setter。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#Current 与 Base 数值接口|职责与输出]]",
      "x": 850,
      "width": 840,
      "color": "5",
      "y": 6725,
      "height": 350
    },
    {
      "id": "numeric-health-native-base-write",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## HealthSet提交原Base\nTrySetCurrentValue仅消费即时Ready／None；原batch未开放且原源有效才提交。\nPushExpectedAttributeChange保存本次属性来源。\nASC.SetNumericAttributeBase(Attribute, CalculatedBase)\n→GAS写有限内部Base→原聚合器dirty求值\n→PreAttributeChange应用Current边界\n→PostAttributeChange记录本次ObservedCurrent。\n原setter返回后Pop标记；不把后读GetCurrent当本次结果。",
      "width": 740,
      "color": "5",
      "x": 2480,
      "y": 6725,
      "height": 280
    },
    {
      "id": "numeric-own-post-confirmed",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 本次Post确认\n标记确实观察到原写入、输入未拒绝且ObservedCurrent有限／匹配DesiredCurrent→本次提交成立。\nHealthSet保留原委托与结果顺序；Damage消息沿原幅度和原帧发布。\nnative回调后的嵌套治疗／direct写入是另一真实事实，不能替换本次ObservedCurrent。\n确认失败→明确诊断；只撤本帧尚未确认的Damage候选。\n[[Messages/结构#HealthSet 的 Current 结算|结果与消息消费]]",
      "width": 680,
      "color": "1",
      "x": 4240,
      "y": 6725,
      "height": 280
    },
    {
      "id": "numeric-current-write-rejected",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 拒绝或来源失效\nPre支持性计算Rejected／Stale→该meta Modifier不进入存储。\nPost计算Rejected／Stale→不提交候选Base，明确原因。\nnative提交未确认→明确失败，不伪发本帧Damage成功消息。\n已发生的meta清理／嵌套写入保留真实结果，不宣称整GE原子回滚。\n不旁写Current、不移除Buff、不采用不可逆float回落或补偿。",
      "x": 850,
      "width": 840,
      "color": "3",
      "y": 7440,
      "height": 230
    },
    {
      "id": "numeric-client-same-base",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 原Base重求值\n重读实际Base／Current／Max并核有限。\nCurrent≤Max→无需投影；Current>Max→安装本次依赖来源标记。\nASC.SetNumericAttributeBase(Attribute, SameBase)\n→GAS保留原GE／预测修饰求值\n→PreAttributeChange限Current→真实Post记录。\n标记确认实际有限Current落在0～Max；失败明确诊断。\n原变化委托保留，自身投影不伪发业务消息；真实嵌套GE／direct写入继续正常配对。\n不调用权威逆算，不加Tick／Timer／RPC或第二复制调度器。",
      "width": 840,
      "color": "5",
      "x": 1790,
      "y": 7880,
      "height": 290
    },
    {
      "id": "numeric-client-max-receive",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 客户端Max依赖请求\nOnRep_MaxHealth／MaxPoise或有效Max Post→RequestClientMaxReevaluation。\n本PreNetReceive固定弱Owner／ASC；请求绑定本次FNetReceiveFrame。\nSuper::PostNetReceive排空原生dirty后，先退休本次请求，再重核原源并调用ReevaluateClientMax。\n无NetReceive且native batch关闭→沿同一同步入口；来源失效／仍开放batch→明确失败。\n[[Messages/结构#客户端上限的 NetReceive 投影|复制生命周期]]",
      "width": 840,
      "color": "4",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7910,
      "height": 260
    },
    {
      "id": "ability-input-group-wake-flow",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2480,
      "y": 550,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 720,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## 真实GroupFreed→ASC有限等待唤醒\nNotifyAbilityEnded先摘原组登记→Super减少ActiveCount/广播→返回后组仍空才BroadcastAbilityGroupFreedIfEmpty。\nWakeQueuedAbilityInputRequests先取整个非零QueuedWaitOrder集合、全部清零，再按首次真实Queued顺序处理。\n逐原请求缓冲内QueueAbilityInputRetry，核精确ID/Tag/deadline、来源与Policy；active/blocked/expired等拒绝候选也已被取走。\n合法项加入既有PendingRetries，随后OnAbilityGroupFreed供外部观察。\n唯一下一次Process再消费许可并TryActivateAbility；不在组空回调直接Try，不加Tick/Timer。\n仅新真实Queued失败可回到等待尾部；残留Spec许可不让请求每次组空永久复活。\n组空不代表GA结束；SwitchReturnPending登记的等待在标签移除后的Process走同一唤醒。\n[[GGYGO_流程_能力仲裁.canvas|仲裁子图]]"
    }
  ],
